<title>FINLAND: Finnish Q2 GDP up 0.3 pct q/q, up 1.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Q2 GDP up 0.3 pct q/q, up 1.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) at market prices rose 1.6 percent year-on-year in the second quarter of 1996, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Tuesday in a statement.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, Q2 GDP grew 0.3 percent on Q1, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Q2 '96	Q1 '96	Q2 '95</p>
<p> Quarter/Quarter     +0.3	  +1.0	  +0.3</p>
<p> Year/Year	     +1.6	  +1.4	  +4.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 '96 revised from 0.7 pct q/q and 1.0 pct yr/yr.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
